Corresponding Source
--------------------
The complete, unmodified source code corresponding to the binaries in this
release is included in this release as `minio-${UPSTREAM_TAG}-source.tar.gz`.
This satisfies the obligation in AGPL §6(d) to offer equivalent access to the
Corresponding Source from the same place at no further charge.

Verification
------------
SHA-256 checksums for every binary in this release are listed in SHA256SUMS.
Builds use `-trimpath` and `CGO_ENABLED=0` for reproducibility; given the same
Go toolchain version recorded above, anyone can rebuild from the included
source tarball and obtain identical binaries.
